Cheyenne, Wyoming 82001.
2.
Purpose of Agreement. The purpose of this Agreement is to authorize the CSO to use the
Cheyenne Civic Center for Youth Education Concerts, hereafter “Program”, subject to the terms and
conditions in this Agreement, on the date contained in Attachment A, attached hereto, incorporated
by reference and expressly made a part of this Agreement.
3.
Term. This Agreement is effective when all parties have executed it and all approvals have
been granted. The term of this Agreement is from July 1, 2018, through June 30, 2019.
4.
Payment. The City agrees to pay the CSO the sum of Six Thousand Five Hundred Dollars
($6,500.00) for the services set forth in Attachment A upon acceptance of performance by the City.
The payment is to be made upon receipt of the accounting records discussed in this Agreement. If
the scope of the Program changes, amendments to this Agreement shall be in writing.
Payment by the City to the CSO for the services performed under the terms and conditions
of this Agreement is contingent upon the availability of City ftinds which are appropriated and
allocated for payment of such obligations. The City shall notify the CSO at the earliest possible time
of any such shortages or depletion of fimds.
