g.
Prior Approval. This Agreement will not be binding upon either party, no services
will be performed under the terms of this Agreement nor payment made until this Agreement has
been approved by all necessary authorities.
h.
Governmental Immunity. The City of Cheyenne expressly invokes governmental
immunity for any claim arising out of this Agreement, pursuant to the Wyoming Governmental
Claims Act, Wyo. Stat. § 1-39-101, etseq.
i.
Termination. It is mutually agreed and understood that the City reserves the right to
cancel this Agreement at anytime, provided, however, that the City shall pay the CSO on a pro rata
basis for services rendered up to the time ofcancellation. Notwithstanding the above, the CSO shall
not be relieved of liability to the City for damages sustained by the City because ofany breach ofthis
