### Page 5 of 5

```text
ATTACHMENT A
The Cheyenne Symphony Orchestra will present two free Youth Education Concerts on
Thursday, January 24, 2019, at 9:30 a.m. and 1:00p.m., to all fifth and sixth graders from Laramie
County School District Nos. 1 and 2, Parochial Schools and Home Schools. The concerts will be
held in the Cheyenne Civic Center. Anticipated student attendance is projected to be 3,000.
```
